{"page":290,"verses":[{"verse_key":"17:76","surah":17,"ayah":76,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِن كَادُوا۟ لَيَسْتَفِزُّونَكَ مِنَ ٱلْأَرْضِ لِيُخْرِجُوكَ مِنْهَا ۖ وَإِذًا لَّا يَلْبَثُونَ خِلَـٰفَكَ إِلَّا قَلِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They planned to scare you off the land, but they would not have lasted for more than a little while after you.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِن","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-in","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَادُوا۟","en_gloss":"they were about","transliteration":"kādū","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَيَسْتَفِزُّونَكَ","en_gloss":"(to) scare you","transliteration":"layastafizzūnaka","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","en_gloss":"the land","transliteration":"l-arḍi","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِيُخْرِجُوكَ","en_gloss":"that they evict you","transliteration":"liyukh'rijūka","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنْهَا ۖ","en_gloss":"from it","transliteration":"min'hā","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِذًۭا","en_gloss":"But then","transliteration":"wa-idhan","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":9,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَلْبَثُونَ","en_gloss":"they (would) have stayed","transliteration":"yalbathūna","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":11,"ar":"خِلَـٰفَكَ","en_gloss":"after you","transliteration":"khilāfaka","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":12,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":13,"ar":"قَلِيلًۭا","en_gloss":"a little","transliteration":"qalīlan","verse_key":"17:76"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٧٦","en_gloss":"(76)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"17:76"}]},{"verse_key":"17:77","surah":17,"ayah":77,"ar_uthmani":"سُنَّةَ مَن قَدْ أَرْسَلْنَا قَبْلَكَ مِن رُّسُلِنَا ۖ وَلَا تَجِدُ لِسُنَّتِنَا تَحْوِيلًا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Such was Our way with the messengers We sent before you, and you will find no change in Ou